fin-foundation:FinancialIdentifierAssignment a owl:Class;
    rdfs:comment "authority-scoped temporal fact assigning exactly one governed IdentifierValue version to exactly one subject version. Logical identity is (assigning-authority logical IRI, assignmentId); the standard version key is (validFrom, knowledgeFrom, availableFrom, revision). The exact scheme version is evidence, not an independent scheme truth: its versionOf must equal the IdentifierValue's scheme logical IRI and be PIT-eligible. An active assigningAuthority authorization must cover the assignment valid interval. hasPrimaryIdentifier is prohibited; convenience identifier properties are derived views only.";
    rdfs:label "Financial Identifier Assignment";
